WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.200
Narrator: The same stand, the same people.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.100
Narrator: Ninety seconds ago they were celebrating.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Narrator: Now they're angry.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.700
Narrator: Nobody in this crowd changed - but the mood did.

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Narrator: In this lesson you'll learn how football crowds think and feel, what changes their mood, and how to spot it early.

